# Testing

## Unit (Vitest)

- Co-locate `*.test.ts` near source; mock factories (`vi.mock` on `*.factory.ts`).
- Coverage scope: `domain`, `application`, `common/errors`, `common/adapters/http` — threshold 90%.
- Do not unit-test Supabase adapters — use E2E tests.

## Integration

- `tests/integration/` — placeholder; dev usa Supabase Cloud.
- CI E2E sobe Supabase local efêmero automaticamente.

## E2E

- `tests/e2e/` + Playwright; `make test-e2e` after build + migrate + seed.
- CI runs all layers on PRs only (not duplicated on CD push to main).

Commands: `make test`, `make test-coverage`, `make check`.
